<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the</p>
<p>Spanish first division on Sunday:</p>
<p>Rayo Vallecano 2 (Stjepan Andrijasevic 35th minute, Guilherme</p>
<p>39th) Hercules 1 (Manuel Alfaro 7th). Halftime 2-1. Attendance</p>
<p>5,000.</p>
<p>Oviedo 0 Deportivo Coruna 1 (Donato 89th). 0-0. 18,000.</p>
<p>Logrones 0 Sporting Gijon 2 (Igor Lediakhov, pen 26th, Oliete</p>
<p>79th). 0-1. 14,000.</p>
<p>Real Sociedad 3 (Gheorghe Craioveanu 8th, 35th, Javier Gracia</p>
<p>72nd) Extremadura 0. 2-0. 16,000.</p>
<p>Racing Santander 2 (Vladimir Beschastnykh 70th, Gabriel</p>
<p>Schurrer 79th) Real Madrid 2 (Davor Suker pen, 76th, Predrag</p>
<p>Mijatovic 85th). 0-0. 23,000.</p>
</text>
